      "seed": 137,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u00abcore/game\u00bb  Session \u00b7 Target \u00b7 Input\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSession: -cfg Config -state atomicLifecycle -timer timer -confirm confirmation\n         -throttle *movement.Throttle -roster roster\n         +NewSession(processes,cfg) +Start(w,h) +Update(w,h) +IsRunning() +Stop()\n         +StartTime() +Throttle() +Targets() +AvailableTargets()\n         +TimeLimit() +TimeLeft() +PendingConfirm() +RequestConfirm(t)\nTarget: embeds process.Info + movement.Motion \u00b7 State State \u00b7 KillAnimationTick\n        +NewTarget() +Tag() +Update() +Kill() +Reap()\n        -isAlive() -isDead() -isHitAt(x,y) -move() -doomsdayTick()\nInput: -s *Session  +NewInput(s) *Input\n       +OnQuit() +OnYes() *Target +OnNo() +OnSpeedUp() +OnSpeedDown()\n       +OnClickAt(x,y) *Target\ninternals: timer \u00b7 confirmation \u00b7 roster \u00b7 atomicLifecycle (unexported, back Session)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 280,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u00abcore/game\u00bb  Session \u00b7 Target \u00b7 Input\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSession: -cfg Config -state atomicLifecycle -timer timer -confirm confirmation\n         -throttle *movement.Throttle -roster roster\n         +NewSession(processes,cfg) +Start(w,h) +Update(w,h) +IsRunning() +Stop()\n         +StartTime() +Throttle() +Targets() +AvailableTargets()\n         +TimeLimit() +TimeLeft() +PendingConfirm() +RequestConfirm(t)\nTarget: embeds process.Info + movement.Motion \u00b7 State State \u00b7 KillAnimationTick\n        +NewTarget() +Tag() +Update() +Kill() +Reap()\n        -isAlive() -isDead() -isHitAt(x,y) -move() -doomsdayTick()\nInput: -s *Session  +NewInput(s) *Input\n       +OnQuit() +OnYes() *Target +OnNo() +OnSpeedUp() +OnSpeedDown()\n       +OnClickAt(x,y) *Target\ninternals: timer \u00b7 confirmation \u00b7 roster \u00b7 atomicLifecycle (unexported, back Session)",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
